# The installer package's manifest (format: packages/README.md).
package installer
version 0.2.0
summary pkg install from directories, zip archives of them, and https URLs of such archives: candidates verified against the trust store's pins, resolution, a GOAP plan staging, verifying and installing each package after its dependencies, a commit written down first and finished after a crash, the store's epochs and trust.lock
entry installer.patlang
include installer.patlang
depends trust >= 0.1.0, < 0.2.0
depends resolve >= 0.2.0, < 0.3.0
depends zip >= 0.2.0, < 0.3.0
depends tls >= 0.2.1, < 0.3.0
file installer.patlang sha256 e487d3c87e3e8007fa1a3360bea2c7156be2c262aff37fbb65292a0a42c6fec9
